WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.852
LENTIL-WALNUT BURGERS:

00:00:07.634 --> 00:00:08.765
1/3 cup (35g) chopped walnuts

00:00:08.765 --> 00:00:09.667
1/3 cup (40g) chopped red onion

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:10.628
2 tbsp minced fresh parsley

00:00:10.628 --> 00:00:11.594
1 tbsp ground flaxseed
mixed with 2 tbsp warm water

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:12.351
1 tbsp white miso paste

00:00:12.351 --> 00:00:15.931
1/2 tsp onion powder
1/2 tsp garlic powder
1/4 tsp paprika
1/4 tsp sodium-free salt substitute (optional)
1/4 tsp ground pippali or black pepper

00:00:15.986 --> 00:00:19.934
1.5 cups (300g) cooked (not wet) brown lentils

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:21.354
1/2 cup (50g) rolled oats,
or more as needed

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.511
1 tbsp roasted garlic (optional)

00:00:25.957 --> 00:00:29.172
Bake at 375°F (190°C)
8 mins per side

00:00:29.172 --> 00:00:31.429
CHEESY SAUCE:

00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:33.402
1/2 cup (60g) raw cashews

00:00:33.402 --> 00:00:34.788
1 tsp rice vinegar

00:00:34.788 --> 00:00:36.100
1/3 cup (80ml) water

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:39.173
3 tbsp nutritional yeast
1/8 tsp ground turmeric
1 tsp smoked paprika

00:00:39.173 --> 00:00:40.500
2 tsp white miso paste

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:04.700
Lentil-Walnut Burgers with Cheesy Sauce

